                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "text",
                    "value": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              "min": 0
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "description": "Failed slice creates over the trailing hour, by the API server's status reason. Forbidden, Invalid and OwnershipConflict need an operator; InternalError, TooManyRequests and Unknown usually clear on retry. Every retry counts, so a create that keeps failing keeps climbing. Empty until a create fails. After a controller restart, the first failure of each reason is not counted: it only starts that reason's series.",
